{"seq":11,"slug":"translation-interpretation","title":"翻译与口译","stage":"DONE","category":"english-learning","chapterCount":5,"docCount":20,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/translation-interpretation","rating":{"composite":3.49,"verdict":"watch","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.43,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introMarkdown":"# 翻译与口译 简介\n\n翻译是两种语言之间的桥梁，口译则是这座桥梁上最考验即时反应能力的通道。在全球化深度交融的今天，翻译与口译早已不再是少数语言天才的专利——它是每一位双语工作者都可以系统习得的专业技能。无论你是希望从事职业翻译，还是在日常工作中需要处理双语文档和跨语言沟通，掌握翻译的核心方法论都将极大提升你的语言运用能力。\n\n本知识库面向具备中级以上英语水平的学习者，尤其适合对翻译行业感兴趣的语言爱好者、需要处理双语内容的技术从业者、以及正在备考翻译资格考试的考生。你不需要有专业翻译经验，但需要具备基本的中英文阅读和写作能力。\n\n全书共分五个章节：\n\n第一章**翻译基础**从翻译学的核心理论出发，讲解信达雅的标准演变、文本类型分析方法和现代翻译工具的使用，为你建立完整的翻译认知框架。\n\n第二章**笔译实践**聚焦书面翻译的核心技能，分别探讨英译中和中译英的差异化策略，深入技术翻译的精确性要求和文学翻译的艺术性追求，帮助你在不同类型的笔译任务中游刃有余。\n\n第三章**口译技能**系统训练口译的核心能力，从交替传译的笔记法到同声传译的分脑训练，再到记忆强化技巧，逐步构建你的口译能力体系。\n\n第四章**专业翻译**深入四个高需求的垂直领域——法律翻译、医学翻译、商务翻译和本地化翻译，讲解各领域的术语规范、行业惯例和质量标准。\n\n第五章**质量与职业发展**从翻译质量评估体系到 CATTI 考试备考策略，从自由译者的职业规划到人工智能对翻译行业的深刻影响，帮助你将翻译技能转化为可持续的职业竞争力。\n\n建议按章节顺序阅读。前两章打好理论和笔译基础，第三章进入口译专项训练，第四章拓展专业领域能力，第五章规划职业路径。如果你已有一定翻译经验，可以直接跳到感兴趣的章节深入学习，但建议至少通读第一章以校准你的翻译理论认知。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"translation-fundamentals","title":"翻译基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/translation-interpretation/translation-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"translation-theory","title":"翻译理论概述","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/translation-interpretation/translation-fundamentals/translation-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"faithfulness-expressiveness","title":"信达雅与翻译标准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/translation-interpretation/translation-fundamentals/faithfulness-expressiveness"},{"seq":3,"slug":"text-types","title":"文本类型与翻译策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/translation-interpretation/translation-fundamentals/text-types"},{"seq":4,"slug":"translation-tools","title":"翻译工具与技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/translation-interpretation/translation-fundamentals/translation-tools"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"written-translation","title":"笔译实践","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/translation-interpretation/written-translation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"english-to-chinese","title":"英译中技巧","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/translation-interpretation/written-translation/english-to-chinese"},{"seq":2,"slug":"chinese-to-english","title":"中译英方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/translation-interpretation/written-translation/chinese-to-english"},{"seq":3,"slug":"technical-translation","title":"科技翻译实务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/translation-interpretation/written-translation/technical-translation"},{"seq":4,"slug":"literary-translation","title":"文学翻译鉴赏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/translation-interpretation/written-translation/literary-translation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"interpreting-skills","title":"口译技能","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/translation-interpretation/interpreting-skills","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"consecutive-interpreting","title":"交替传译训练","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/translation-interpretation/interpreting-skills/consecutive-interpreting"},{"seq":2,"slug":"simultaneous-interpreting","title":"同声传译入门","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/translation-interpretation/interpreting-skills/simultaneous-interpreting"},{"seq":3,"slug":"note-taking","title":"口译笔记法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/translation-interpretation/interpreting-skills/note-taking"},{"seq":4,"slug":"memory-training","title":"口译记忆训练","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/translation-interpretation/interpreting-skills/memory-training"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"professional-translation","title":"专业翻译","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/translation-interpretation/professional-translation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"legal-translation","title":"法律翻译实务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/translation-interpretation/professional-translation/legal-translation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"medical-translation","title":"医学翻译入门","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/translation-interpretation/professional-translation/medical-translation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"business-translation","title":"商务翻译技巧","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/translation-interpretation/professional-translation/business-translation"},{"seq":4,"slug":"localization","title":"本地化与全球化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/translation-interpretation/professional-translation/localization"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"quality-and-career","title":"质量与职业发展","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/translation-interpretation/quality-and-career","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"quality-assessment","title":"翻译质量评估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/translation-interpretation/quality-and-career/quality-assessment"},{"seq":2,"slug":"catti-certification","title":"CATTI 考试备考","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/translation-interpretation/quality-and-career/catti-certification"},{"seq":3,"slug":"freelance-translation","title":"自由翻译职业规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/translation-interpretation/quality-and-career/freelance-translation"},{"seq":4,"slug":"ai-in-translation","title":"AI 与翻译的未来","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/translation-interpretation/quality-and-career/ai-in-translation"}]}]}